# db-scaffold

For creating tables, adding/renaming/dropping columns or indexes, adding
foreign keys, or otherwise designing or evolving a schema in this project's
camel migrations, follow the full instructions in
`.cursor/skills/db-scaffold/SKILL.md` (installed by `camel skill install`).

Read the project's `camel.yaml` and existing migration files first, converge
on the exact column/index/foreign-key shape with the user in plain chat
(never add inferred relations or indexes silently), write the migration file
matching camel's DSL, then validate it with `camel plan --file <path>
--direction up` (and `--direction down`) before considering the task done.
